<title>FRANCE: TENNIS-HINGIS WINS PARIS OPEN TITLE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-HINGIS WINS PARIS OPEN TITLE.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the final in the $450,000 Paris Open women's tennis tournament played on Sunday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>1-Martina Hingis (Switzerland) beat 3-Anke Huber (Germany) 6-3 3-6 6-3.</p>
</text>
